### Create a new user

    Purpose:
        create user
    Endpoint:
        /user/create
    Request Method:
        POST
    Request Body (JSON):
        1. email | string | required | max50
        2. first_name | string | required | max50
        3. last_name | string | required| max50
        4. gender | string | required   | max50
        5. birth_date | string | required
        6. country | string | required | max50
        7. goals | string | required | max500
        8. platform | string | required | max20
        9. password | string | required
        Example:
            {
                "email": "user@gmail.com",
                "first_name": "bruce",
                "last_name": "li",
                "gender": "Male",
                "birth_date": "2006-01-02",
                "country": "AF",
                "goals": "I want to learn meditation",
                "platform": "mr",
                "password": "12345678",
            }
    Result Body (JSON):
            Example:
            {
                "status": "success",
                "message": "User successfully created.",
                "user": {
                    "id": 1,
                    "email": "user@gmail.com",
                    "first_name": "Bruce",
                    "last_name": "Li",
                    "gender": "Male",
                    "birth_date": "2006-01-02",
                    "country": "AF",
                    "goals": "I want to learn meditation.",
                    "platform": "mr",
                    "total_time_spent": 0
                },
                "data": {
                    "token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxMjM0NTY3ODkwIiwibmFtZSI6IkpvaG4gRG9lIiwiaWF0IjoxNTE2MjM5MDIyfQ.SflKxwRJSMeKKF2QT4fwpMeJf36POk6yJV_adQssw5c",
                    "expires_in": 3600 // in seconds
                }
            }

    Success:
        201 - User successfully created
    Failure:
        500 - Server Error while creating a user

