### Fetch user information

    Purpose:
        Fetching user information in the app
    Endpoint:
        /user/get-info/{user_id}
    Request Method:
        GET
    Request Parameters:
        1. user_id | int | required
        Example:
            GET /user/get-info/1
    Request Header:
        1. Authorization | `Bearer <token>` | required
        Example:
        {
            `Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...`
        }
    Request Body (JSON):
        1. user_id | int | required
        Example:
            {
                "user_id": 1,
            }
    Result Body (JSON):
            Example:
            {
                "status": "success",
                "message": "User found.",
                "user": {
                    "id": 1,
                    "email": "user@gmail.com",
                    "first_name": "Bruce",
                    "last_name": "Li",
                    "gender": "Male",
                    "birth_date": "2006-01-02",
                    "country": "AF",
                    "goals": "I want to learn meditation.",
                    "platform": "mr",
                    "total_time_spent": 0
                },
            }

    Success:
        200 - User information fetched and returned
    Failure:
        401 - Unauthorized (token incorrect or expired)
        404 - password or email not correct
        500 - Server Error while fetching user information

