### ForgotPassword

    Purpose:
        Request a password reset link for the user.
    Endpoint:
        /user/forgot-password
    Request Method:
        POST
    Request Body (JSON):
        1. email | string | required | max50
        Example:
            {
                "email": "user@gmail.com"
            }
    Result Body (JSON):
        Example:
            {
                "status": "success",
                "message": "Password reset link has been sent to your email."
            }
    Success:
        200 - Password reset link sent successfully
    Failure:
        400 - Bad Request (email not provided or invalid)
        404 - User not found (email does not exist in the database)
        500 - Server Error while processing the request

### Delete User

    Purpose:
        Delete a user account from the system.
    Endpoint:
        /user/delete/{user_id}
    Request Method:
        DELETE
    Request Header:
        1. Authorization | `Bearer <token>` | required
        Example:
            {
                "Authorization": "Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..."
            }
    Request Parameters:
        1. user_id | int | required
        Example:
            DELETE /user/delete/1
    Result Body (JSON):
        Example:
            {
                "status": "success",
                "message": "User account has been successfully deleted."
            }
    Success:
        204 - User account deleted successfully (no content returned)
    Failure:
        401 - Unauthorized (token incorrect or expired)
        404 - User not found (user_id does not exist in the database)
        500 - Server Error while processing the request
